# The clang-format that fetch-clang-format.py installs here, and its pin marker.
# Fetched rather than committed: it is a ~4 MB per-platform binary, and every dev's copy is reproducible from the pin.
# The tool binaries we DO commit (diag-launcher.exe and friends) are not matched by these patterns.
clang-format
clang-format.exe
clang-format.part
clang-format.exe.part
.clang-format-pin.txt
